{"five_whys":{"problem":"Viable air sampling at FH1-B7 exceeded the action limit (12 CFU/4 h plate vs Action 10) and surface swab at transfer hatch TH-2 exceeded its action limit (8 CFU/25 cm2 vs Action 5); preliminary isolates include Staphylococcus epidermidis (human flora) at both locations and an unidentified fungal colony at TH-2, with gowning breaches at TH-2 and an overdue hatch gasket integrity check also noted.","ordered_steps":["Why did CFU counts exceed action limits at FH1-B7 and TH-2?","Why was microbial contamination introduced into the Grade A/B environment?","Why did gowning breaches recur and why was the hatch gasket integrity check overdue?","Why were gowning adherence and preventive maintenance not effectively controlled?","Why did the quality management system allow continued filling without pending EM results and overdue checks?"],"why_1":{"level":1,"question":"Why did CFU counts exceed action limits at FH1-B7 and TH-2?","answer":"Microbial contamination was introduced into the Grade A/B environment, evidenced by human flora (Staphylococcus epidermidis) and fungal growth at the affected locations.","evidence":["FH1-B7 viable air: 12 CFU/4 h plate vs Action 10","TH-2 surface swab: 8 CFU/25 cm2 vs Action 5","Staphylococcus epidermidis isolated at both locations","Unidentified fungal colony at TH-2"],"basis":"stated","status":"ai_suggested","origin":"ai"},"why_2":{"level":2,"question":"Why was microbial contamination introduced via personnel and/or the transfer hatch?","answer":"Gowning breaches at TH-2 allowed human flora shedding, and the overdue hatch gasket integrity check suggests the hatch barrier may have been compromised.","evidence":["Three gowning breaches logged at TH-2 in past month","Material transfer without proper gowning","Hatch gasket integrity check due since Sep-2026 (overdue)","Previous TH-2 monitoring showed 4 CFU (alert level)"],"basis":"stated","status":"ai_suggested","origin":"ai"},"why_3":{"level":3,"question":"Why did gowning breaches recur and why was the gasket integrity check not completed on time?","answer":"Procedural adherence at TH-2 was not consistently enforced, and preventive maintenance scheduling or tracking for the hatch gasket was inadequate.","evidence":["Repeated gowning breaches over past month without recorded intervention","Overdue integrity check despite alert-level trend at TH-2","No documented immediate actions for prior exceedance"],"basis":"inferred","status":"ai_suggested","origin":"ai"},"why_4":{"level":4,"question":"Why were procedural enforcement and maintenance tracking inadequate?","answer":"There may be insufficient supervision, training gaps, or lack of automated alerts for overdue environmental and equipment checks.","evidence":["Multiple breaches at same location over one month","Filling continued after B7 plate retrieval before results arrived next day","No documented immediate actions in incident record"],"basis":"inferred","status":"ai_suggested","origin":"ai"},"why_5":{"level":5,"question":"Why were supervision, training, or alert controls insufficient?","answer":"The quality management system lacked robust controls to halt operations pending EM results and to ensure timely completion of critical integrity checks.","evidence":["Batch filling continued after plate retrieval and before results available","Recurring issues at TH-2 indicate systemic gap rather than isolated event","Detected datetime and immediate actions not explicitly documented"],"basis":"inferred","status":"ai_suggested","origin":"ai"}},"fishbone":{"man":[{"factor":"Gowning breaches at transfer hatch TH-2 (personnel not properly gowned)","evidence":["Three gowning breaches logged at TH-2 in past month","Material transfer without proper gowning"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Personnel shedding of human flora (Staphylococcus epidermidis)","evidence":["Staphylococcus epidermidis isolated at FH1-B7 and TH-2","Staphylococcus epidermidis is human flora"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Inadequate gowning training or supervision (hypothesis)","evidence":["Repeated breaches at same location over past month","No documented corrective action after prior breaches"],"basis":"inferred"}],"machine":[{"factor":"Transfer hatch TH-2 equipment","evidence":["TH-2 inner surface swab exceeded action limit (8 CFU/25 cm2 vs Action 5)","Same hatch showed 4 CFU in previous monitoring round (alert level)"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Overdue hatch gasket integrity check","evidence":["Hatch gasket integrity check due since Sep-2026","Check not completed as of incident date 27-Oct-2026"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Compromised hatch gasket allowing contamination ingress (hypothesis)","evidence":["Overdue integrity check","Elevated CFU at TH-2 inner surface","Alert-level trend (4 CFU previous round)"],"basis":"inferred"}],"method":[{"factor":"Filling continued after viable air plate retrieval before EM results available","evidence":["Filling of batch 0777 continued after B7 plate was retrieved","Results arrived the next day"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Gowning procedure not followed during material transfer at TH-2","evidence":["Three gowning breaches logged at TH-2","Material transfer without proper gowning"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Lack of immediate corrective action on prior alert-level result at TH-2 (hypothesis)","evidence":["Previous monitoring round showed 4 CFU at TH-2 (alert level)","No documented immediate actions in incident extraction"],"basis":"inferred"}],"material":[{"factor":"Unidentified fungal colony at TH-2","evidence":["Fungal colony at TH-2 pending identification","Isolated from transfer hatch TH-2 inner surface"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Ceftriaxone Injection product batch SIV-26-0777 at risk","evidence":["Batch SIV-26-0777 Ceftriaxone Injection","Potential microbial contamination risk to batch"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Effectiveness of cleaning/disinfecting materials at TH-2 (hypothesis)","evidence":["Recurring microbial detection at TH-2","No data on disinfectant efficacy provided"],"basis":"inferred"}],"measurement":[{"factor":"Viable air sampling exceedance at FH1-B7","evidence":["FH1-B7: 12 CFU/4 h plate vs Action 10","FH1-B3: 6 CFU/4 h plate (within limit)"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Surface swab exceedance at TH-2","evidence":["TH-2 inner surface: 8 CFU/25 cm2 vs Action 5"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Detection delay in environmental monitoring results","evidence":["Results arrived the next day after plate retrieval","Detected datetime not explicitly documented"],"basis":"inferred"}],"environment":[{"factor":"Grade A/B Filling Hall FH-1 environmental conditions","evidence":["Site area: Sterile Injectables, Filling Hall FH-1 (Grade A/B)","Incident date: 27-Oct-2026"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Presence of human flora and fungal organisms in cleanroom environment","evidence":["Staphylococcus epidermidis (human flora) at FH1-B7 and TH-2","Unidentified fungal colony at TH-2"],"basis":"stated"},{"factor":"Potential airflow or pressure differential issues at TH-2 (hypothesis)","evidence":["Elevated counts at transfer point TH-2","Grade A/B area requires controlled pressure and airflow"],"basis":"inferred"}}},"warnings":["Fungal colony identification at TH-2 is pending; detected datetime and immediate actions are not explicitly documented in the request."]}
